<title>USA: NHL ICE HOCKEY-SUNDAY'S STANLEY CUP PLAYOFF RESULTS.</title>
<headline>NHL ICE HOCKEY-SUNDAY'S STANLEY CUP PLAYOFF RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of first-round National Hockey League Stanley Cup playoff games on Sunday (home team in CAPS):</p>
<p>	   Eastern Conference</p>
<p> Ny Rangers	  3    Florida	 0</p>
<p>(Best-of-seven series tied 1-1)</p>
<p>	   Western Conference</p>
<p> CHICAGO	     4    Colorado	3 (2ND OT)</p>
<p>(Colorado leads best-of-seven series 2-1)</p>
<p> Detroit	     3    St Louis	2</p>
<p>(Detroit leads best-of-seven series 2-1)</p>
<p> EDMONTON	    4    Dallas	  3</p>
<p>(Edmonton leads best-of-seven series 2-1)</p>
<p> Phoenix	     4    ANAHEIM	 1</p>
<p>(Anaheim leads best-of-seven series 2-1)</p>
